| channel-telegram | keep | C6 polling twin. Fix the poller (#2); add `/new` deduplication (low). |
| channel-telegram-webhook | keep | C6 webhook twin. Add a test that keeps the shared files identical. |
| conversations-file | keep, not the default | Second independent provider, which `checkStability` needs before `conversations.registry` can become stable. The verdicts conflicted (delete vs keep); this rule decides. |
| conversations-kv | keep, the default | Neutral and named in C5. The http preset switches to it plus storage-kv-sql. |
| credentials-file | keep | Own 0600 store; the OAuth write-back target. |
