| Item | Cost |
|---|---|
| outbound-durable wakeups mode, then restore the durable target, with a workerd eviction test | M |
| workerd test: answer delivery across an eviction, with and without the outbox | M |
| Convergence suite run over `startAnswerDelivery` through storage-kv-sql | S–M |
