Sub-claims refuted inside items that were otherwise confirmed:
- that outbound-durable's loop keeps the object resident forever (it is evicted 70-140 s after going idle);
- RESUME_AT_ONCE described as a two-layer duplicate (`recover` does more work than that);
- agent.submissions described as untested on runtime-pi (`recovery.test.ts` covers it);
- the answers feed suite running only in workerd (`answers.test.ts`);
- merging the tools into `tool-coding` or `tool-files`;
- deleting conversations-file outright;
- a local `beforeRemove` hook as the outbox guard (it only sees the dev database);
- `pikit add --preset`;
- bumping the contracts minor only for stable entries;
- a new upstream proposal for optional pi-ai SDKs (already declined);
- copying `features/` into projects;
- the "silently" wording about model keys (it is documented, though inconsistent);
- the `memory-sqlite` naming drift (it is a hypothetical name);
- the provider barrel as M5-safe (it is not, unbundled under Bun).

